      "message": "Right. But `arm-pl011-uart` is part of the public API of `arm-fvp-base-pac`, so updating the latter to a version of the former with a breaking change is also a breaking change. The new version of `arm-fvp-base-pac` should have been called 0.2.0 rather than 0.1.4.",
