      "writtenOn": "2025-10-17T10:30:13Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "There was no breaking change in `arm-pl011-uart` so having 0.1.4 as the `arm-fvp-base-pac` version is correct. The issue is caused by RF-A using `arm-pl011-uart` both as a direct dependency and as a dependency of `arm-fvp-base-pac`. This can happen with any other crate with a similar setup.\n\n    error[E0308]: mismatched types\n       --\u003e src/platform/fvp.rs:193:50\n        |\n    193 |         logger::init(LockedWriter::new(Uart::new(uart_pointer)))\n        |                                        --------- ^^^^^^^^^^^^ expected `arm_pl011_uart::PL011Registers`, found `arm_fvp_base_pac::arm_pl011_uart::PL011Registers`\n        |                                        |\n        |                                        arguments to this function are incorrect\n        |\n    note: two different versions of crate `arm_pl011_uart` are being used; two types coming from two different versions of the same crate are different types even if they look the same",
      "parentUuid": "8deea935_6e638330",
      "revId": "0169e3716cafd35af890c4ae91776c5780c02456",
      "serverId": "8f6f209b-db1a-4cbf-aa44-c8bc30e9bfda"
    },
