      "writtenOn": "2025-10-17T10:48:30Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "`arm-pl011-uart` 0.3.2 to 0.4.0 is a semver breaking change. Whenever you update a dependency of your crate which is exposed as part of the public API of your crate past a semver breaking version bump, that is itself a breaking change to your crate, precisely for this reason: anyone depending on both your crate and directly on the dependency gets broken.\n\n(And in this case, it happens that the breaking change in `arm-pl011-uart` from 0.3.2 to 0.4.0 was itself because of a dependency update; the `embedded-io` dependency was updated from 0.6 to 0.7.1.)",
      "parentUuid": "6b9cd1cf_e2c803f0",
